      ],
      "text_preview": "Further, the petitioner has not been furnished with the Food Analyst report and has been deprived of the statutory right of Appeal as mandated under Section 46(4) of the Act and further the biscuits manufactured by the petitioner have an ex"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "38406253253d43788668831ecda82a9e_68",
