        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, present petition being devoid of any merits, be dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3491484ca2a643ebabd939ef91f7f7aa_70",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The first ground which has been raised by the petitioner which requires appreciation is as to whether the laboratory from where the food sample was sent for testing was accredited by National Itc Limited vs State Of Madhya Pradesh on 27 Nov"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a94dee7f575b415eabd39c0a7d003b89_71",
