      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accreditation Board for Testing and Calibration Laboratories (NABL) by notification as envisaged under Section 43 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and if not what would be the effect?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00870393f23543be9fac992fdf9bab75_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAdmittedly, the sample of Sunfeast Dream Cream Biscuit were taken from one Ishika Agency on 30.05.2012."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9f677454ce284badbbc1e2230363f357_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On 12.04.2012, DD (E-II) had issued an information that as per Section 43 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the Food Authority has notified following laboratories accredited by National Accreditation Board for Testing and Calibration "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "993343d5cd4b4978bad252be9c4f7bab_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
