      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the State Food Testing Laboratory, Bhopal is not one of the laboratories which was accredited by National Accreditation Board and therefore, cannot be said to be a laboratory recognized by the Food Authority under Section 43(1) "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7bd85be044d49428f6d3fd81edeaee1_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nEven the said laboratory is not a laboratory established or notified by the Central or State Government with respect to Rule 2.4.2(2) of Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56f4b6c8ad6449be8c4ebee8ccf06759_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the said matter, the report of Food Analyst dated 15.06.2012 looses its significance as the sample was not analysed by the accredited laboratory under Section 43 of the Food Safety and Standards Act,\n2006."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b5c9077765f14a1cafc7a506390e3680_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the report which is the foundation for launching prosecution against the petitioner cannot be relied upon and hence, the prosecution launched against the petitioner is not sustainable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2aaf8daae3fc45cab53110f943bae330_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. In terms of Rule 2.4.3. of Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011, the Designated Officer after receipt of report of Food Analyst is required to forward the sample to referral laboratory for analysis and if the referral laboratory report"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f55d7a31803d47a4ab8ef9c4368a1593_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. Further, as per Rule 2.4.5 Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011, the Food Business Operator has a right to have the food analysed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "48e0aa994e534927a8ddac3f581d0ade_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This procedure was not followed as no notice as required under Rule 2.4.1(4) was sent to the petitioner due to which the petitioner could not exercise its right to get the sample sent to laboratories accredited by National Accreditation Boa"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "91c414e38eb24489ae6404d285ccdd2a_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even the right to appeal could not be exercised by the manufacturer, instead notice was sent to proprietor of Ishika Agency which is not a compliance of the aforesaid Rule."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "17a710b20c1f4d629758e5ece48a1988_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. So far as the plea taken by the respondent/State that since there is availability of alternative remedy to the petitioner as provided under Section 70(1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act,\n2006, therefore, the present petition is not"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "df480e3df4564a48b03271230b97cdd2_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "By the said order, the said plea had been discarded and negatived."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bdf69fd32ff64f39b969ee80b304d894_106",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
